<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown on paging cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown on paging cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it altered its ratings on two paging companies.</p>
<p>-- Downgraded Paging Network Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Upgraded Mobile Telecommunication Technologies Corp to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Mobile Telecom shares rose 1/4 to 10-1/4 and PageNet shares gained 1/4 to 6-9/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
